#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:7
msgid ""
"minios-live - step-by-step build tool for creating bootable MiniOS ISO images"
msgstr ""
"minios-live - Schritt-für-Schritt-Werkzeug zum Erstellen bootfähiger MiniOS-"
"ISO-Abbilder"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:7 minios-cmd.1:7 condinapt.1:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNTAX"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:10
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] [\\f[I]start_cmd\\f[R]] \\f[B]-\\f[R] "
"[\\f[I]end_cmd\\f[R]]\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] [\\f[I]start_cmd\\f[R]] \\f[B]-\\f[R] "
"[\\f[I]end_cmd\\f[R]]\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: minios-live.1:10 minios-cmd.1:9 condinapt.1:9 condinapt-minios.7:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "BESCHREIBUNG"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:17
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] is a step-by-step build tool that builds bootable "
"MiniOS ISO images.  It uses pre-defined configurations to create a "
"customized MiniOS live system with a controlled and modular build process, "
"including the ability to add software layered on top of the base system "
"using SquashFS modules.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] ist ein Schritt-für-Schritt-Bauwerkzeug, das "
"bootfähige MiniOS-ISO-Abbilder erstellt. Es verwendet vordefinierte "
"Konfigurationen, um ein angepasstes MiniOS-Live-System mit einem "
"kontrollierten und modularen Bauprozess zu erzeugen, einschließlich der "
"Möglichkeit, Software mithilfe von SquashFS-Modulen auf das Basissystem "
"aufzusetzen.\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: minios-live.1:17 minios-cmd.1:15 minios-cmd.1:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build Options"
msgstr "Build-Optionen"

#. type: Plain text
#: minios-live.1:20
msgid ""
"Using \\f[B]minios-live\\f[R], you can build various configurations "
"including:\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Mit \\f[B]minios-live\\f[R] können Sie verschiedene Konfigurationen "
"erstellen, darunter:\\fR"

